cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "pm25-benchmark: a leakage-safe benchmark toolkit for PM2.5 forecasting"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit that downloads, cleans and aligns open air-quality
  datasets and runs leakage-safe PM2.5 forecasting benchmarks: persistence,
  seasonal and trailing-mean baselines against ridge regression and random
  forests, with chronological splits, a purge gap, rolling-origin
  evaluation and block-bootstrap confidence intervals.
